# Peer-dependency conflicts are resolved explicitly (US-260): package.json
# "overrides" for React 19 and drei -> fiber 9, and version bumps where a
# compatible release exists (three, Capacitor 7.x, typescript-eslint,
# expo-constants). The reasoning for each is in package.json "comments".
# Do not re-add legacy-peer-deps=true or install with --force; both hide real
# incompatibilities and can resolve a different tree locally than in prod.
